  "title": "Top of the Tower",
  "prompt": "View from the inside of a luxury, penthouse apartment, looking out to the huge floor to ceiling windows at the night sky, and the incredible city scape - include a variety of buildings, and a river dotted with boats ect.\n\nThe inside of the apartment it is cosy and modern. It is dark in the apartment apart from a lamp that lets out a gentle warm glow. The vibe is moody, atmospheric - it's raining hard outside, and you can hear the wind this high up buffeting the tallest building in the city that you're at the top of.\n\n---\n\nFeel free to add/tweak to this - those are my ideas so far. I want something moody, a bit melancholy - kind of like a modern 'lonely king' at the top of the tower feel",
